      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5286 - Ibn Mahbub narrated from Abu Jameelah from Aban ibn Taghlib from Abu Abdullah Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) who said:\n\"For the lower lip, the compensation is six thousand (dirhams), and for the upper lip, it is four thousand (dirhams) because the lower lip holds water.\""
